      "description": "Smoothies have become a staple in my breakfast routine. They are so easy to make and such a refreshing sip on a sunny summer morning!\n\nI have used avocados in my smoothies before and after making this one, I don’t think I would ever make a smoothie without an avocado in it as they make them so creamy and delicious!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1/2 cup canned coconut milk\n1 1/2 cup unsweetened almond milk\n1 teaspoon vanilla extract\n3 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend\n2 teaspoon instant coffee\n3 tablespoon unsweetened cocoa powder\n1/2 medium avocado\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 2 servings of Keto Mocha Smoothie. Each serving comes out to be 249 calories, 21.7g fat, 6g net carbs, and 4.5g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
